  m_Name: GItem_FarmBox
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: VoxelEngine::VoxelEngine.GridSystem.GridBlockItem
  itemId: gitem_farmbox
  displayName: Large Farm Plot Box
  description: Ship-mounted floor farm. A 3x3 bed in one hull cell, the only grid
    plot that takes a tree sapling in its centre socket. Needs grid power, water
    through a liquid port, and breathable air - a sealed breathable room or a breathable
    world under the hull. Crops pause without air instead of dying, and ripe beds
    are moved into connected grid cargo.
